_(Snapshots To Keep)_:
: <input type="text" id="zfsm-copysched-keep" maxlength="40" placeholder="all" value="<?=zfsmHtml(zfsmKeepField($zfsm_copysched['keep']))?>">

:zc_settings_copysched_keep_plug:
> A number keeps the newest that many; `7d 4w 12m` keeps the newest of each of the last 7 days, 4 weeks and 12 months. Empty keeps all. [Snapshots to keep](https://github.com/chodeus/ZFS-Master-NG/wiki/Schedules#snapshots-to-keep)
:end

_(Copy Keeps)_:
: <input type="text" id="zfsm-copysched-copy-keeps" maxlength="40" placeholder="same as source" value="<?=zfsmHtml(zfsmCopyKeepsField($zfsm_copysched['copy_keeps'] ?? null))?>">

:zc_settings_copysched_copy_keeps_plug:
> What each copy keeps. Empty keeps the same as its dataset, `all` keeps every snapshot, and rules such as `30d 12m` set the copy's own. [Copy Keeps](https://github.com/chodeus/ZFS-Master-NG/wiki/Schedules#copy-keeps)
