_(Leave Out)_:
: <input type="text" id="zfsm-copysched-leave-out" placeholder="none" value="<?=zfsmHtml(zfsmLeaveOutField($zfsm_copysched))?>">

:zc_settings_copysched_leave_out_plug:
> Datasets at the top of a pool to skip, split by commas, such as `appdata, backup_*`. [Leave Out](https://github.com/chodeus/ZFS-Master-NG/wiki/Schedules#leave-out)
:end

&nbsp;
: <input type="button" id="zfsm-copysched-save" value="_(Save)_" onclick="zfsmEverySave('zfsm-copysched', 'schedulecopies')"> <span id="zfsm-copysched-status" aria-live="polite"></span>

